Paite Open Language Data: licence and rights

This repository contains original work and third-party text. Each part has its
own terms.

1. Original work: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

   Applies to:
   - corrections.json
   - grammar_notes.md
   - the "verified_words", "verified_examples", and "verified_corrections"
     entries in paite_phrasebook.json
   - README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, CITATION.cff, and this file
   - the selection, arrangement, and file formats of the collection

   You can copy, share, and adapt this work for any purpose, including
   commercial use, if you give credit to "Paite Open Language Data
   (github.com/khooptong-sudo/paite-open-language-data)" and state your changes.
   Full licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

   This also covers the files in scripts/.

2. Public domain

   - The English Bible text (World English Bible).

3. Used with permission

   - The Paite Bible text in bible/laisiangthou/ and the Bible rows in
     training/. Source: the Laisiangthou app (v5.0.2) by John Samte
     (https://github.com/johnsamte), who gave permission for its use in this
     repository. Credit John Samte when you use this text. Ask him before any
     commercial use.

4. Third-party text: NOT licensed by this repository

   - Paite Bible text in bible/legacy-etabetapi/ (collected from
     etabetapi.com). Copyright of the original Paite Bible publisher.
   - Dictionary data in dictionary/Paite+English+Dictionary_1_1_4_apkcombo_com.json
     and the "dictionary" key of paite_phrasebook.json. Copyright of the
     author of the "Paite English Dictionary" Android app.
   - Hymn lyrics and snippets in songs/Kristian+Labu_1_4_53_apkcombo_com.json,
     songs/Biakna+Labupi_1_0_0_apkcombo_com.json, and the "song_titles" key of
     paite_phrasebook.json. Copyright of the hymn authors, translators, and
     app publishers.

